---
const publicationUrl = '/publications/l-argent-d-epstein/';
---

<aside class="epstein-epub" data-pagefind-ignore aria-labelledby="epstein-epub-title">
  <img
    src="/publications/l-argent-d-epstein-cover.png"
    width="1600"
    height="2560"
    loading="lazy"
    decoding="async"
    alt="Couverture de L’argent d’Epstein"
  />
  <div>
    <p class="epstein-label">// édition complète</p>
    <h2 id="epstein-epub-title">Sept enquêtes réunies dans un volume.</h2>
    <p>
      Retrouvez ce chapitre, les six autres volets, vingt infographies et leurs sources
      dans l’édition numérique de <cite>L’argent d’Epstein</cite>.
    </p>
    <a href={publicationUrl}>
      Découvrir l’EPUB gratuit <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .epstein-epub {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.35rem;
    margin: 3rem 0 2rem;
    padding: 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-signal) 38%, var(--color-line));
    border-radius: 12px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(120deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-signal) 8%, transparent), transparent 55%),
      var(--surface-elevated);
  }

  .epstein-epub img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line-strong);
    border-radius: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);
  }

  .epstein-label {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .epstein-epub h2 {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-bright);
    font-family: var(--font-read);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .epstein-epub p:not(.epstein-label) {
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-prose);
    font-family: var(--font-read);
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .epstein-epub a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-signal);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.035em;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-signal) 40%, transparent);
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .epstein-epub {
      grid-template-columns: 4.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
